  "adaptations": [
    "Add erased declare fields, typed method signatures, local exports/imports; preserve all original instance field assignments and static data assignments at their original positions.",
    "Bind only Math.random to the exact local driver generator, reset once before each original iteration. Preserve all 52 shuffle draws per hand.",
    "Keep dealOneCard returning string|undefined and Hand cards storing the same union; a checked card receiver preserves the original undefined TypeError instead of asserting success or inventing a card.",
