    "Wrap the original full-house threeOfAKindCardRank < 12 boolean in Number at its original bitwise use; do not replace the comparison with an intended shift.",
    "Each work call constructs the original Benchmark and four Players once, then runs all requested complete iterations with cumulative original statistics. This user-authorized independent trial includes setup in work, while the release driver constructed Benchmark outside its iteration timer.",
